<report>
<title>Odds ratio analysis</title>

<p>Odds Ratio = <in>odds</in></p>

<p>Using the Woolf (logit) approximation:<br />
<ci>Approximate <in>woolf_ci</in>% confidence interval = <in>woolf_ci_1</in> to <in>woolf_ci_2</in></ci></p>

<p>Using conditional likelihood estimation:<br />
<ci>Fisher exact <in>ci</in>% confidence interval = <in>llf</in> to <in>ulf</in></ci><br />
<pval>Exact Fisher one sided <inp>p1f</inp>, two sided <inp>p2f</inp></pval><br />
<ci>mid-P exact <in>ci</in>% confidence interval = <in>llm</in> to <in>ulm</in></ci><br />
<pval>Exact mid-P one sided <inp>p1m</inp>, two sided <inp>p2m</inp></pval></p>
</report>
